  speechLines:
  - "Citizens: Uy, it\u2019s detective!"
  - "Tandang: Is everyone okay?\r"
  - "Citizens: We\u2019ll be alright, detective.\r"
  - "Tandang: Any of you saw the assailant or their whereabouts?\r"
  - "Citizens: We happen to see them up North! They fiddled around with a secubot
    nearby.\r"
  - "Tandang: Alright, thanks. Stay safe now.\r"
